{"overview":"پس از هفت ماه بدون یافتن قاتل در پروندهٔ قتل دخترش، میلدرد هیز تصمیم جسورانه‌ای می‌گیرد و سه تابلو با پیام جنجالی به سمت بیل ویلوگی، رئیس محترم پلیس شهر، نصب می‌کند. وقتی معاون دوم او، افسر جیسون دیكسن، پسری نابالغ با تمایل به خشونت، درگیر می‌شود، نبرد میلدرد با نیروی قانون ابینگ تنها تشدید می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"After seven months have passed without a culprit in her daughter's murder case, Mildred Hayes makes a bold move, painting three signs leading into her town with a controversial message directed at Bill Willoughby, the town's revered chief of police. When his second-in-command Officer Jason Dixon, an immature mother's boy with a penchant for violence, gets involved, the battle between Mildred and Ebbing's law enforcement is only exacerbated.","tagline_en":"A mother personally challenges the local authorities to solve her daughter's murder when they fail to catch the culprit.","runtime":115,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["مارتین مک‌دونا"],"crew_en":["Martin McDonagh"],"countries":["GB","US"],"cast":[{"name":"فرانسیس مک‌دورمند","role":"Mildred","photo":"/gBkoteKZshmQXEyEoyT6WE7N0tF.jpg","en":"Frances McDormand"},{"name":"وودی هارلسون","role":"Willoughby","photo":"/igxYDQBbTEdAqaJxaW6ffqswmUU.jpg","en":"Woody Harrelson"},{"name":"سام راکول","role":"Dixon","photo":"/afYhNpLwpa65Yy0Q0g00FNFhzx5.jpg","en":"Sam Rockwell"},{"name":"ابی کورنیش","role":"Anne","photo":"/AgIA8uPnwySIbqaPjr5jEXwZbS.jpg","en":"Abbie Cornish"},{"name":"لوکاس هجز","role":"Robbie","photo":"/8WP1uXUwm6Z1vzrMaIiKj89M6kX.jpg","en":"Lucas Hedges"},{"name":"زلجکو ایوانک","role":"Desk Sergeant","photo":"/xLv19n8UvGJLxI7Z6RIv9eNXGmf.jpg","en":"Željko Ivanek"},{"name":"Caleb Landry Jones","role":"Red Welby","photo":"/8M5lPHrERwAIfWK56RkH30FOjhV.jpg"},{"name":"Clarke Peters","role":"Abercrombie","photo":"/ouDHDpocxXgXrosF3vShAEkOjHL.jpg"},{"name":"سامارا ویوینگ","role":"Penelope","photo":"/ngVKl0sxrut5PPMAIDsfXrVjA1R.jpg","en":"Samara Weaving"},{"n